{"page":152,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:12","surah":7,"ayah":12,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ مَا مَنَعَكَ أَلَّا تَسْجُدَ إِذْ أَمَرْتُكَ ۖ قَالَ أَنَا۠ خَيْرٌ مِّنْهُ خَلَقْتَنِى مِن نَّارٍ وَخَلَقْتَهُۥ مِن طِينٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God said, ‘What prevented you from bowing down as I commanded you?’ and he said, ‘I am better than him: You created me from fire and him from clay.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"(Allah) said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"What","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَنَعَكَ","en_gloss":"prevented you","transliteration":"manaʿaka","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَلَّا","en_gloss":"that not","transliteration":"allā","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَسْجُدَ","en_gloss":"you prostrate","transliteration":"tasjuda","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَمَرْتُكَ ۖ","en_gloss":"I commanded you","transliteration":"amartuka","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"(Shaitaan) said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَنَا۠","en_gloss":"I am","transliteration":"anā","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"better","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِّنْهُ","en_gloss":"than him","transliteration":"min'hu","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":12,"ar":"خَلَقْتَنِى","en_gloss":"You created me","transliteration":"khalaqtanī","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":14,"ar":"نَّارٍۢ","en_gloss":"fire","transliteration":"nārin","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَخَلَقْتَهُۥ","en_gloss":"and You created him","transliteration":"wakhalaqtahu","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":17,"ar":"طِينٍۢ","en_gloss":"clay","transliteration":"ṭīnin","verse_key":"7:12"},{"pos":18,"ar":"